# Momo, Playful Pet {W} 1/1 flying, vigilance: "When Momo leaves the battlefield, choose one - Create a Food token; Put a +1/+1
# counter on target creature you control; Scry 2." Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Momo on turn 2 with Savannah Lions and Ornithopter (Bot1's) and
# Elvish Mystic (Bot2's) in play: the counter mode may target Bot1's creatures only (Momo herself has left), so Bot2's Mystic is
# refused and the Lions get it, not the Ornithopter. No Food token is made by that mode.

